@startuml
title SD – Agendar consulta (Admin)

actor Admin
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "auth-service" as Auth
participant "appointments-service" as App
participant "clients-service" as Clients
participant "doctors-service" as Doctors
participant "RabbitMQ" as Rabbit
participant "notes-service" as Notes
participant "clients-service\n(Rabbit listener)" as ClientsSub
participant "doctors-service\n(Rabbit listener)" as DoctorsSub

== Login Admin ==
Admin -> GW : POST /auth/login (email, pass)
GW -> Auth : /auth/login
Auth --> GW : JWT
GW --> Admin : JWT

== Admin agenda consulta ==
Admin -> GW : POST /appointments/admin\nAuthorization: Bearer JWT
GW -> App : POST /appointments/admin

App -> Clients : GET /patients/{patientId}\nX-INTERNAL-KEY
Clients --> App : PatientClientResponse

App -> Doctors : GET /physicians/{physicianId}\nX-INTERNAL-KEY
Doctors --> App : PhysicianClientResponse

App -> App : validar conflitos\nexistsBy...()

App -> App : appointmentRepository.save(...)
App -> Rabbit : publish AppointmentCreatedEvent\nroutingKey = appointment.created
App --> GW : 200 OK + AppointmentResponse
GW --> Admin : Consulta criada

== Consumo assíncrono ==

Rabbit -> Notes : appointment.created
Notes -> Notes : criar AppointmentRecord\n(diagnóstico/tto/prescrição default)

Rabbit -> ClientsSub : appointment.created
ClientsSub -> ClientsSub : atualizar lastAppointmentDate\n+ appointmentCount

Rabbit -> DoctorsSub : appointment.created
DoctorsSub -> DoctorsSub : atualizar totalAppointments\n+ lastAppointment

@enduml
